            "title": "EXCLUSIVE: TransCode Therapeutics Reports Progress In Early-Stage Study For Lead Cancer Drug",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "TransCode Therapeutics, Inc. (NASDAQ:RNAZ) announced further progress on Thursday in its Phase 1a clinical trial of TTX-MC138 in patients with metastatic cancer. To date, 13 patients have received at least one dose of TTX-MC138 at four separate dose levels ranging from 0.8 mg/kg to 4.8 mg/kg. Two patients have been treated in the expanded enrollment. Eight patients remain on the study for continued treatment, receiving an additional dose of TTX-MC138 during each 28-day treatment cycle, and may r",
            "pubDate": "2025-05-01T12:32:30Z",
